title: "The Energy Transportation Uncertainty (ETU) Index"
abstract: >-
  A media-based Energy Transportation Uncertainty (ETU) index measuring
  disruptions in the midstream segment of global energy supply chains. Building
  on Baker, Bloom, and Davis (2016), the index tracks threats to energy
  transportation infrastructure through text mining of English-language media
  from January 1969 to December 2024.
type: dataset
